### What a file browser's preview of a model says while it has no picture to
### show: Explorer's preview pane (and Quick Look after it). A thumbnail says
### nothing - a file it cannot draw keeps its ordinary icon.

shell-preview-loading = Loading...
# The model could not be read, or has nothing to draw (an animation saved apart
# from its character). The log names the reason.
shell-preview-failed = This model cannot be previewed
